    "independent_assessment": "Change validates one first literal root directory with bounded raw PAX fields and exact timestamp syntax, rejects global/duplicate/ambiguous/root-path metadata, retains payload keep-old-files extraction, then selects only the validated root via no-recursion second GNU tar pass. Both passes use same held archive/destination descriptors and close with exact archive SHA/full identity checks. This repairs root metadata restoration and changes no learned-state, reference, initial-gain, seed, budget, floor, review capture, Store admission or eligibility rule. Runtime snapshot availability may change; all later live/source/producer/Store requirements still apply.",
