    "actual_five": "Exactly five original budget-complete models at ordered42..46. Missing/incomplete/nonfinite required observations fail; all finite low-quality/no-improvement/zero-update auxiliaries remain. No imputation, replacement, retraining-to-score, score-based selection or episode pooling.",
