    "exact_maximum_only_ties": "RETURN only current complete KeyDoor9-field-state/time proof and reject above-bound episodes; unsupported tasks stay strict. HER actual exhaustive extrema20success/0distance. Arena actual named reference AND final exactly1 from all9 keyed outcomes. No initial-gain tie permitted at any endpoint.",
