  "current_native_consumption_assessment": "Current unchanged policy modules require five ordered original observations and full medians/served0 restrictions. NativeRlCohortPlan and Assessment bind exact canonical projections/plans/seeds and producer-owned calibration. ServingCandidate requires actual complete budget data allfive, selects only0 and preserves old strict served artifact gates. StoredServing physically writes/reads exact completed checkpoint/companion, and StoreLoadedReplay checks physical JMW1/F64 values and full canonical fetched-final replay bytes with process/device evidence. Parent source/lane NativeCriterionReview capture and expected actual55 digest remain required before reserve/spawn, with independent physical policy/evaluation replay afterward. The snapshot metadata change touches none of those gates.",
  "bar_provenance_and_limits": "Native simulators, compact budgets and project-calibrated slacks do not reproduce published recipe anchors. The prospective finite conjunction is meaningful through authentic paired gain, all declared task references, prescribed actual training seeds, old median quality and served0 own restrictions. No population/generalization probability or supervised-null guarantee transfers to RL/HER/self-play. If a strong fixed reference makes a task infeasible, this review permits no relaxation.",
